{
  "server": "cn",
  "storyId": "act17d0_level_act17d0_06_beg",
  "groupId": "act17d0",
  "stageId": "act17d0_06",
  "title": "领主宅邸攻防战",
  "storyCode": "OD-6",
  "avgTag": "行动前",
  "sourcePath": "vendor/ArknightsData/cn/gamedata/story/activities/act17d0/level_act17d0_06_beg.txt",
  "sourceHash": "4490733362647d0fa74a3e21467032a9ae93ce87e24eafa33dc00ac9df228b5d",
  "bodyAvailable": true,
  "blocks": [
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "德鲁奇",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_158_1#2",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "我们有多久没见面了，我亲爱的妹妹？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "德鲁奇",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_158_1#2",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "半年，一年，还是更久？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "皮加尔",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_159_1#2",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "德鲁奇，你袭击领主卫队，攻占领主府邸，这是在谋反！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "德鲁奇",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_158_1#2",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "谋反，哼，呵呵。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "德鲁奇",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_158_1#2",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "你应该知道，皮加尔。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "德鲁奇",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_158_1#2",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "如果不是老头子那腐朽的脑袋里还想着保护他那些感染的......啊，劣质资产。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "德鲁奇",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_158_1#2",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "这位子根本轮不到你坐。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "德鲁奇",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_158_1#2",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "冷静点，妹妹。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "德鲁奇",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_158_1#2",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "看看这个，这些玩具来自一位哥伦比亚的热心赞助商。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "德鲁奇",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_158_1#2",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "TSW-2号超声波冲击装置，高精尖工业产品，尚未投入实战的实验武器，唯一的缺点是尺寸太大。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "德鲁奇",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_158_1#2",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "我把它藏在镇子里，可是花了不少时间。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "德鲁奇",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_158_1#2",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "把你从大宅里骗出来，也花了我不少时间。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "德鲁奇",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_158_1#2",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "所以我亲爱的妹妹，你那强大的武技起到什么作用了？你坚强的意志又起到什么作用了？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "皮加尔",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_159_1#2",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "德鲁奇",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_158_1#2",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "你再看看这些朋友，这些萨卡兹朋友。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "德鲁奇",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_158_1#2",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "他们可不是那些死脑筋的魔族佬，他们同样来自哥伦比亚，他们为钱办事。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "德鲁奇",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_158_1#2",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "你知道这代表着什么吗？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "德鲁奇",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_158_1#2",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "他们代表着更先进的东西，是你和老头子永远都不会明白的东西。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "德鲁奇",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_158_1#2",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "只要利润够高，金钱能汇聚的力量远超你的想象。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "德鲁奇",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_158_1#2",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "老头子坚持的那些狗屁不通的道理，现在又到哪儿去了？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "雇佣兵",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_007",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "老大，我们在一间大房子里找到了这个。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "德鲁奇",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_158_1#1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "给我。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "德鲁奇",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_158_1#2",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "哦，巴耶勒王酋的领主委任书。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "德鲁奇",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_158_1#2",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "细纹草纸，绣边签名，砖块一样的巴耶勒文，还有这黝黑盖章。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "德鲁奇",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_158_1#2",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "哼。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "德鲁奇",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_158_1#2",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "老头子呢？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "雇佣兵",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_007",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "没有，我们找遍了所有房间，大宅里只有一大群镇民，没看到你说的老头子。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "皮加尔",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_159_1#2",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "父亲已经过世了，现在我就是长泉镇的领主。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "皮加尔",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_159_1#2",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "你违抗领主，就是违抗王酋，你已经死罪难逃了！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "德鲁奇",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_158_1#2",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "这就是你和那个老东西想出来的计谋？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "德鲁奇",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_158_1#2",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "哈哈哈......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "德鲁奇",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_158_1#2",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "哈哈哈哈哈......"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "皮加尔",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_159_1#2",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "唔呃！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "德鲁奇",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_158_1#2",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "老东西真的是越来越蠢了。你们居然觉得依靠王酋就能将我一军，你真的是天真得可笑。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "德鲁奇",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_158_1#2",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "死罪？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "德鲁奇",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_158_1#2",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "老头子引以为豪的瑞柏巴卫队现在就躺在巷子里身首异处。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "德鲁奇",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_158_1#2",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "最棘手的领主卫队已经没了，你觉得这里还有谁能管我？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "皮加尔",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_159_1#2",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "你这个丧心病狂的废物！他们从小看着你长大！你竟然......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "德鲁奇",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_158_1#2",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "他们不该挡我的道。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "德鲁奇",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_158_1#2",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "你也不该。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "德鲁奇",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_158_1#2",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "看在我们血脉相连的份上，我就讲得再直白一点，便于你理解吧，妹妹。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "德鲁奇",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_158_1#2",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "是，你现在是萨尔贡的领主，没错。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "德鲁奇",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_158_1#2",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "而我呢？我只是一个被家族放逐的流浪汉。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "德鲁奇",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_158_1#2",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "但过个几年，等到你不幸亡故，再由我亲自去一趟巴耶勒王廷。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "德鲁奇",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_158_1#2",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "我既有血统，又带着矿产和大笔财富向王酋表忠心，你觉得他会不会把长泉镇重新分封给我？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "皮加尔",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_159_1#2",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "你！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "德鲁奇",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_158_1#2",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "我再好心地做一个假设，如果你上任没多久就在一场血战中丧生。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "德鲁奇",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_158_1#2",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "我把你的遗体献给王酋，假若你有幸成为长生军的一员，我会不会因此获得更多好处？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "皮加尔",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_159_1#2",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "德鲁奇，你这个卑鄙无耻的败类！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "德鲁奇",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_158_1#2",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "别这么激动，妹妹。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "德鲁奇",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_158_1#2",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "当然，前述内容都只是我的假设，假设不会成真，这只是兄妹谈心。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "德鲁奇",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_158_1#2",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "因为我早就想好了更适合你的去处。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "德鲁奇",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_158_1#2",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "看到这些身上带石块的东西吗？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "德鲁奇",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_158_1#2",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "既然你那么愿意保护感染者，不妨就加入他们吧。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "皮加尔",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_159_1#2",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "德鲁奇！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "德鲁奇",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_158_1#2",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "等你因此而亡的时候，我会找个山洞把你填进去。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "德鲁奇",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_158_1#2",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "这样，你和老头就能看着我是怎么把矿洞底下深藏的源石挖出来，让长泉镇变成整个巴耶勒的矿产中心。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "德鲁奇",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_158_1#2",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "怎么，不说话了？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "皮加尔",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_159_1#2",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "......你在出卖你的家族，出卖这片土地！我诅咒你，德鲁奇，你不得好死！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "德鲁奇",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_158_1#2",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "随你开心，我亲爱的妹妹，你想咒多久就咒多久，趁你还有本事说话。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "德鲁奇",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_158_1#2",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "那就这样吧。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "德鲁奇",
      "speakerToken": "char_empty",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "（哥伦比亚语）你，过来。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "萨卡兹雇佣兵",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_053",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "（哥伦比亚语）老板，你说。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "德鲁奇",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_158_1#1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "（哥伦比亚语）把那些感染者带到学者那边去。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "米亚罗",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_160_1#1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "咳咳......咳......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "萨卡兹雇佣兵",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_053",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "（哥伦比亚语）好的，我把他们带给科学家。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "萨卡兹雇佣兵",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_053",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "（哥伦比亚语）这个年轻人呢？看起来快不行了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "德鲁奇",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_158_1#1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "（哥伦比亚语）是死是活都带过去。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "德鲁奇",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_158_1#1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "（哥伦比亚语）至于我妹妹。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "德鲁奇",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_158_1#1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "（哥伦比亚语）把她变成感染者，你们萨卡兹人肯定知道怎么弄。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "萨卡兹雇佣兵",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_053",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "（哥伦比亚语）明白。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "萨卡兹雇佣兵",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_053",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "（哥伦比亚语）不过这可不是合同规定的工作内容，得加钱。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "德鲁奇",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_158_1#1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
