      "text": "五个！这就是你的怪物吗？德鲁奇！滚出来面对我！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "皮加尔",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_159_1#2",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "六个！你们这些丑陋肮脏的怪物，来啊！我要把你们全都砸成碎片。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黑",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_166",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "冷静一点，皮加尔小姐，节省体力。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黑",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_166",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "它们......数量太多了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "米亚罗",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_160_1#1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "不......咳咳......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "米亚罗",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_160_1#1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "皮加尔大人......黑小姐......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黑",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_166",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "医生！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "米亚罗",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_160_1#1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "你们......咳，咳......快跑！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "米亚罗",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_160_1#1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "来吧，怪物......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黑",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_166",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "......你要做什么？"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "米亚罗",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_160_1#1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "（痛......好痛。）"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "米亚罗",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_160_1#1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "（我在哪儿......我晕倒了？）"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "米亚罗",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_160_1#1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "（这是......）"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "皮加尔",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_159_1#2",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "......你在出卖你的家族，出卖这片土地！我诅咒你，德鲁奇，你不得好死！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "米亚罗",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_160_1#1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "（皮加尔大人！跪在地上？）"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "米亚罗",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_160_1#1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "（出什么事了？）"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "米亚罗",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_160_1#1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "（啊......痛......）"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "米亚罗",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_160_1#1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "咳咳......咳......"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "米亚罗",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_160_1#1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "（这是......血？）"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "米亚罗",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_160_1#1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "（啊......）"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "米亚罗",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_160_1#1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "（痛......好冷。）"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "德鲁奇",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_158_1#1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "（哥伦比亚语）把那些感染者带到学者那边去。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "萨卡兹雇佣兵",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_053",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "（哥伦比亚语）好的，我把他们带给科学家。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "萨卡兹雇佣兵",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_053",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "（哥伦比亚语）这个年轻人呢？看起来快不行了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "德鲁奇",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_158_1#1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "（哥伦比亚语）是死是活都带过去。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "德鲁奇",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_158_1#1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "（哥伦比亚语）至于我妹妹。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "德鲁奇",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_158_1#1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "（哥伦比亚语）把她变成感染者，你们萨卡兹人肯定知道怎么弄。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "米亚罗",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_160_1#1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "（他......他要对感染者做什么？）"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "米亚罗",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_160_1#1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "（站不起来......）"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "米亚罗",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_160_1#1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "（那是谁......）"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "米亚罗",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_160_1#1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "（是黑小姐......）"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "米亚罗",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_160_1#1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "（只有一个人......）"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "米亚罗",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_160_1#1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "（得帮帮她......）"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "米亚罗",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_160_1#1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "（哈......最终还是要用这种方法。）"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "米亚罗",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_160_1#1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "你们......快逃......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黑",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_166",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "你要做什么！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "米亚罗",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_160_1#2",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "别管我！快跑！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黑",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_166",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "那是精炼源石锭？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黑",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_166",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "你这是要......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黑",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_166",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "！！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "米亚罗",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_160_1#2",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "源石技艺......很久没有用过了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "米亚罗",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_160_1#2",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "（还有很多想做的事情。）"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "米亚罗",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_160_1#2",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "（还不想死......）"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "米亚罗",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_160_1#2",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "（医生的天职就是拯救生命，我在......拯救......）"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "术师雇佣兵",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_007",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "我的眼睛！我的眼睛！啊啊啊！！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "萨卡兹雇佣兵",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_053",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "站起来！保持阵型！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "德鲁奇",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_158_1#1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "咳咳......咳。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "德鲁奇",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_158_1#1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "怎么回事......那是什么啊！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "雇佣兵",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_007",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "畸变体，畸变体不受控制了！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "德鲁奇",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_158_1#1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "为什么？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "德鲁奇",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_158_1#1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "超声波发生器呢？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "雇佣兵",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_007",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "被那个混小子炸坏了！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "雇佣兵",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_007",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "全都失控了！怎么办？！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "雇佣兵",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_007",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "咕哇！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "萨卡兹雇佣兵",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_053",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "菲林又开始攻击了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "萨卡兹雇佣兵",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_053",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "架盾，保护老板！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "皮加尔",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_159_1#2",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "德鲁奇！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "皮加尔",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_159_1#2",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "我要你偿命！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "德鲁奇",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_158_1#1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "你们到底在磨蹭什么！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "德鲁奇",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_158_1#1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "我现在就要这群家伙人头落地！"
